---
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
const updated = "14 June 2026";
const supportEmail = "support@didibhaiyakibiryani.com";
---

<LegalPage
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms that govern your use of Didi Bhaiya ki Biryani's website and apps for ordering 100% vegetarian dum biryani."
  updated={updated}
>
  <p>
    These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your use of the <strong>Didi Bhaiya ki Biryani</strong>
    website and apps operated by D&amp;B Foods. By placing an order or using the Services you accept
    these Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Eligibility &amp; accounts</h2>
  <p>
    You must be 18 or older to create an account. You are responsible for keeping your login secure
    and for activity under your account. Email verification (OTP) is required at sign-up.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Orders &amp; pricing</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Menu, prices, taxes and delivery charges are shown before you confirm an order and may change.</li>
    <li>An order is confirmed once accepted by the kitchen; we may decline or cancel orders (e.g. item unavailable, outside delivery area, suspected fraud).</li>
    <li>All food is 100% vegetarian and prepared to order.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Payments</h2>
  <p>
    Payments are taken via Cash on Delivery or online through our payment gateway (Razorpay).
    You agree to pay the total shown at checkout.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Cancellations &amp; refunds</h2>
  <p>
    You may cancel before the kitchen begins preparation. Once preparation starts, an order generally
    cannot be cancelled. Approved refunds are returned to the original payment method. Contact
    <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}>{supportEmail}</a> for refund or quality issues.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Delivery</h2>
  <p>
    Delivery times are estimates and may vary with demand, weather and traffic. Please provide an
    accurate address and a reachable phone number.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>You agree not to misuse the Services, attempt to disrupt them, or use them for unlawful purposes.</p>

  <h2>7. Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>The brand, logo, content and software are owned by D&amp;B Foods and may not be used without permission.</p>

  <h2>8. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by law, the Services are provided “as is” and our liability for any claim
    is limited to the value of the order concerned.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
  <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India, with courts at Bengaluru, Karnataka having jurisdiction.</p>

  <h2>10. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions? Email <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}>{supportEmail}</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
